ation time to the licence service.</p></div><div class="policy"><h2>Support</h2><p>Users choose what screenshots, files or diagnostic information they share for support. Passwords, OTPs, portal credentials and unrelated confidential data should not be shared.</p></div><div class="policy"><h2>Contact</h2><p>Samriddhi Associates<br/>+91-98299-27177</p></div></div></section><footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-grid"><div><h3>Samriddhi Associates</h3><p>Practical software tools for GST professionals, businesses and authorised users.</p><p><strong>Contact:</strong><br/><strong>Samriddhi Associates</strong><br/>8, Basement Floor, Okay Plus Complex, Near Bus Stand, Kishangarh, Ajmer - 305801<br/>Cell : +91-98299-27177</p></div><div><h3>Products</h3><a href="../gst-tool/index.html">GST &amp; E-Way Login Tool</a><a href="../gst-return-downloader/index.html">GST Return Downloader</a><a href="../gstr-2b-reconciliation/index.html">GSTR-2B Reconciliation</a><a href="../gmail-sender/index.html">Bulk Gmail Sender</a><a href="../bank-sales-purchase-to-tally/index.html">Bank + Sales + Purchase to Tally</a><a href="../tally-custom-report/index.html">Tally Custom Report</a><a href="../debtors-analysis-tool/index.html">Debtors Analysis Tool</a></div><div><h3>Legal</h3><a href="../privacy.html">Website Privacy</a><a href="../terms.html">Website Terms</a><a href="../refund-cancellation.html">Refund &amp; Cancellation</a><a href="../contact.html">Contact</a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom">Developed by Samriddhi Associates, 8, Basement Floor, Okay Plus Complex, Near Bus Stand, Kishangarh, Ajmer - 305801 Cell : +91-98299-27177</div></footer></body></html>